This bears saying plainly for a diving application: Yemoja is a logbook, with an aid to
understanding dives already made and to planning dives not yet made. It is not a dive
computer, and it has been certified neither as one nor as planning software. Any
decompression figure it shows, including every figure in a plan, is one model's estimate
and may be wrong. The copyright holder accepts no responsibility for any dive planned,
made or judged with the software's help. Diving is dangerous, and responsibility for your
dives is yours alone.
